[quote="lynkfox"]

there is usually a surge at the end of kickstarters - we can hope someone like Penny Arcade or CAD or other gaming oriented web comics with HUGE followings tweets or posts about the last day of the expansion, and it skyrockets. - that is not out of reach (perhaps those around here who may be semi close with such figures extend a hand to ask for linkage? :) )

[/quote]

&nbsp;

Every KS that&#39;s gaming related gets people suggesting asking Penny Arcade for a shout out at some point - all it does is leads to people spamming them and they don&#39;t give said shout-out. Probably reduces the chance that they do something like that in truth.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

100k should be reached pretty easily, but I&#39;m not sure how much higher the pledges will end. Depending on the surge it could end right around where the EE KS did, or reach up to $150k or so. Bit tough to compare to the EE KS since it was an upgrade + expansion everyone could spend money on, compared to much lower amounts for most people on this KS, so even matching the 111k from that KS would be a huge success IMO.&nbsp;
